<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet" />

    <!-- Font Awesome (for the Algolia icon) -->
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" />

    <title>Bootstrap Navbar</title>

    <script
      defer
      src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <style>
      .navbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 999;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body class="m-0">
    <!-- Navbar Start -->
    <nav
      class="navbar navbar-expand-md navbar-dark bg-black py-3 border-bottom border-dark">
      <div class="container-fluid">
        <button
          class="navbar-toggler"
          type="button"
          data-bs-toggle="collapse"
          data-bs-target="#navbarTogglerDemo03"
          aria-controls="navbarTogglerDemo03"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-label="Toggle navigation">
          <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>

        <a
          class="navbar-brand me-4fs-4"
          href="#"
          style="color: var(--primary-color)">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-algolia fa-lg"></i>
        </a>

        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarTogglerDemo03">
          <ul class="navbar-nav me-auto mb-2 mb-lg-0">
            <li class="nav-item me-4">
              <a class="nav-link custom-nav-link active" href="/">Home</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item me-4">
              <a class="nav-link custom-nav-link" href="/student-register"
                >Student Register</a
              >
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item me-4">
              <a class="nav-link custom-nav-link" href="/student-login"
                >Student Login</a
              >
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item me-4">
              <a class="nav-link custom-nav-link" href="/faculty/login"
                >Faculty Login</a
              >
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link custom-nav-link" href="/about">About</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <!-- Navbar End -->
    <div class="home-body">
      <div
        class="home-body py-5"
        style="--primary-color: #6274dd; background-color: #f8f9fa">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 g-4">
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold text-dark">
                Welcome to the College Portal
              </h1>
              <p class="lead text-muted">
                Your central hub for academic success. Access your grades,
                coordinate with faculty, register for upcoming terms, and stay
                connected with campus life.
              </p>
              <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                <a
                  href="/student-login"
                  class="btn btn-lg px-4 text-white fw-semibold"
                  style="background-color: var(--primary-color)"
                  >Student Access</a
                >
                <a
                  href="/faculty/login"
                  class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg px-4 fw-semibold"
                  style="
                    border-color: var(--primary-color);
                    color: var(--primary-color);
                  "
                  >Faculty Access</a
                >
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
              <div
                class="p-5 bg-white rounded-4 shadow-sm border text-secondary">
                <i
                  class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap fa-10x"
                  style="color: var(--primary-color)"></i>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr class="my-5" />

          <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
            <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3 text-dark">Quick Actions</h2>

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 bg-white">
                <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column">
                  <div class="mb-3">
                    <i
                      class="fa-solid fa-user-plus fa-2x"
                      style="color: var(--primary-color)"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-dark">
                    New Registrations
                  </h5>
                  <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">
                    Are you a new student or faculty member? Complete your
                    registration to get started.
                  </p>
                  <div class="d-flex gap-2 mt-auto">
                    <a
                      href="/student-register"
                      class="btn text-white btn-sm px-3 fw-semibold"
                      style="background-color: var(--primary-color)"
                      >Student Reg</a
                    >
                    <a
                      href="/faculty/login"
                      class="btn btn-sm px-3 fw-semibold"
                      style="
                        border-color: var(--primary-color);
                        color: var(--primary-color);
                        background: transparent;
                      "
                      >Faculty Login</a
                    >
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 bg-white">
                <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column">
                  <div class="mb-3">
                    <i
                      class="fa-solid fa-user-gear fa-2x"
                      style="color: var(--primary-color)"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-dark">Manage Account</h5>
                  <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">
                    Update your portal profile, change passwords, and manage
                    institutional documentation securely.
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="#"
                    class="btn text-white btn-sm px-3 fw-semibold mt-auto align-self-start"
                    style="background-color: var(--primary-color)"
                    >Go to Account</a
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 bg-white">
                <div class="card-body p-4 d-flex flex-column">
                  <div class="mb-3">
                    <i
                      class="fa-solid fa-circle-info fa-2x"
                      style="color: var(--primary-color)"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-dark">
                    About the Institution
                  </h5>
                  <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">
                    Learn more about our university's history, mission
                    statement, academic achievements, and campuses.
                  </p>
                  <a
                    href="/AboutInstitution"
                    class="btn text-white btn-sm px-3 fw-semibold mt-auto align-self-start"
                    style="background-color: var(--primary-color)"
                    >Learn More</a
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-4 shadow-sm border">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
              <h3 class="h4 fw-bold m-0 text-dark">
                <i
                  class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn me-2"
                  style="color: var(--primary-color)"></i
                >Latest Announcements
              </h3>
              <span
                class="badge text-white px-3 py-2"
                style="background-color: var(--primary-color)"
                >Updated Today</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="list-group list-group-flush">
              <div class="list-group-item py-3 bg-white">
                <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
                  <h6 class="mb-1 fw-bold text-dark">
                    Upcoming Term Registration Notice
                  </h6>
                  <small class="text-muted">3 days ago</small>
                </div>
                <p class="mb-1 text-muted text-sm">
                  Course registration for the upcoming semester officially
                  begins next Monday. Ensure your account dues are settled.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="list-group-item py-3 bg-white">
                <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
                  <h6 class="mb-1 fw-bold text-dark">
                    Faculty Grading Deadline
                  </h6>
                  <small class="text-muted">1 week ago</small>
                </div>
                <p class="mb-1 text-muted text-sm">
                  All faculty members are requested to submit final mid-term
                  examination grades through their dashboard portals by Friday.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      ``` ### Style Decisions Applied: * **The Highlight (`#6274dd`):** Used as
      the striking accent color for primary action buttons, modern icons, and
      notice badges. * **The Dark Base (Black/Dark Slate):** Used strictly for
      clear headers, secondary button borders, text, and your existing navbar to
      ground the structure. * **The Light Canvas (White/Off-white):** Used for
      the card backgrounds, announcement container, and content background to
      ensure maximum contrast and professional portal spacing.
    </div>
    <%- include('footer') %>
  </body>
</html>
